      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento kawono winji, E Yakobo ma jatic para, man Israel, m’agoyo wie: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova m’ucwii, m’ung’ini kud i ic, ma bikonyi, uwacu kumae: Lworo kud unegi, E Yakobo ma jatic para; man in, yecurun, m’agoyo wii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum abikonjo pi wi ng’atu ma rieu nege, man kulo wi ng’om m’uthwo; abikonjo Tipona wi kodhini, man mugisa para wi nyikwei: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "e gibidongo kind lum, calu mbegu dhu kulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acel biwacu kumae, An a pa Yehova; man mange bilwongre ku nying’ Yakobo; man mange bigoro wi cinge kumae, Ni Yehova, man ebilwongre ku nying’ Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.44.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
